-- Primebrick: translation-editor sheet v2 keys (public.translations / app.*).
--
-- The redesigned `i18n.translationEditor` sheet adds per-language status
-- badges (saved/missing/modified/draft), the AI suggestion + generate-all
-- review surface, the mandatory-EN gate message, and the partial-flush
